  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving climate change resilience in Caribbean communities through the  International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies (IFRCS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Improving climate change resilience in Caribbean communities through the  International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies (IFRCS) is a component of Improving climate change resilience in Caribbean communities reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xA3;540,508. This project benefits Caribbean, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Environmental policy and administrative management, Environmental education/training.</narrative>
  </description>
